into another character,

00:09:42.109 --> 00:09:46.276
I think it's like shielding
me, and what's inside of me,

00:09:47.761 --> 00:09:49.629
actually, what's in there will come out,

00:09:49.629 --> 00:09:50.483
you know what I'm sayin',

00:09:50.483 --> 00:09:52.596
but I wouldn't regularly say
to people in regular form,

00:09:52.596 --> 00:09:53.735
you know what I'm sayin',

00:09:53.735 --> 00:09:57.187
because I'm a pretty shy dude, so.

00:09:57.187 --> 00:09:59.047
The face paint is kind of like a shield,

00:09:59.047 --> 00:10:00.481
like okay I can hide behind this,

00:10:00.481 --> 00:10:02.647
and say whatever the (bleep) I want to,

00:10:02.647 --> 00:10:04.121
you know what I'm sayin',

00:10:04.121 --> 00:10:05.872
I can tell the world that
I don't give a (bleep),

00:10:05.872 --> 00:10:06.778
you know what I'm sayin'.

00:10:06.778 --> 00:10:09.051
If it ain't about love, I'll
(bleep) you up, you know.

00:10:09.051 --> 00:10:13.218
So, yeah I think that face
paint does a lot for me.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.519
I know it does,

00:10:15.519 --> 00:10:17.353
I feel like a superhero
when that (bleep) on.

00:10:17.353 --> 00:10:21.520
I want people to know that I
bring love through music, man

00:10:22.475 --> 00:10:26.793
you know, I bring happiness,
even if it's dark man,

00:10:26.793 --> 00:10:30.252
you know, a lot of the soldiers
from Afghanistan come to me

00:10:30.252 --> 00:10:34.681
and they say, "You got me through
when I was over there man,

00:10:34.681 --> 00:10:36.919
"your music got me through."

00:10:36.919 --> 00:10:40.551
Even doctors coming to my shows and say,

00:10:40.551 --> 00:10:42.338
"Man, that song The Rain,

00:10:42.338 --> 00:10:44.574
"where you're talking about
being away from your children,

00:10:44.574 --> 00:10:45.551
"I felt it."

00:10:45.551 --> 00:10:47.704
You know, athletes come to me,

00:10:47.704 --> 00:10:50.145
"Man, that song", you
know what I'm sayin',

00:10:50.145 --> 00:10:53.077
"Riot Maker gets me pumped
up before the show."

00:10:53.077 --> 00:10:54.592
you know what I mean,

00:10:54.592 --> 00:10:57.836
James Hetfield, of Metallica, said,

00:10:57.836 --> 00:10:59.792
"We love Einstein", you
know what I'm sayin',

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:02.843
"We listen to Einstein before we go on."

00:11:02.843 --> 00:11:05.426
You know, just crazy stuff man.

00:11:06.338 --> 00:11:10.460
I want to be remembered for
the guy that brought happiness,

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.909
you what I'm sayin', the guy that brought

00:11:12.909 --> 00:11:16.242
that stuff that was so influential, man,

00:11:17.305 --> 00:11:19.916
you know what I mean,
even if I'm talking about

00:11:19.916 --> 00:11:22.558
me almost dying from drugs, you know,

00:11:22.558 --> 00:11:25.244
been clean for like four years,

00:11:25.244 --> 00:11:26.466
I know it didn't look like it

00:11:26.466 --> 00:11:27.888
when I was just scratching my neck,

00:11:27.888 --> 00:11:30.555
but I been clean for four years.

00:11:32.485 --> 00:11:34.233
I just want to be the guy that they know

00:11:34.233 --> 00:11:36.733
that was 100% inside-out.

00:11:38.027 --> 00:11:39.900
He gave everything.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.070
And my reward is great.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:44.878
And my fan base keeps growing
and growing and growing man,

00:11:44.878 --> 00:11:46.176
right before my eyes.

00:11:46.176 --> 00:11:47.093
It's crazy.

00:11:49.312 --> 00:11:51.306
- Thank you guys so much for watching,

00:11:51.306 --> 00:11:53.633
I made this video because
Mad Marlan asked me to,

00:11:53.633 --> 00:11:54.976
so if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:11:54.976 --> 00:11:56.441
that you want me to profile next,

00:11:56.441 --> 00:11:58.799
leave it in the comments below,
and I'll see what I can do.

00:11:58.799 --> 00:12:00.548
I'd also love to know
what did Tech N9ne say

00:12:00.548 --> 00:12:02.261
that had the biggest impact on you,

00:12:02.261 --> 00:12:04.094
what did you learn from this video

00:12:04.094 --> 00:12:05.802
that you're going to immediately apply

00:12:05.802 --> 00:12:07.225
to your business or life.

00:12:07.225 --> 00:12:08.691
Please leave it in the comments below,

00:12:08.691 --> 00:12:10.444
and I'm going to join in the discussion.

00:12:10.444 --> 00:12:12.403
Finally wanted to give a quick shout out

00:12:12.403 --> 00:12:14.233
to Jennifer Price,
Jennifer thank you so much

00:12:14.233 --> 00:12:16.063
for being in the book,
helping with the book,

00:12:16.063 --> 00:12:17.891
but also taking that awesome picture

00:12:17.891 --> 00:12:19.441
while you're doing Christmas shopping,

00:12:19.441 --> 00:12:20.622
and posting it as well,

00:12:20.622 --> 00:12:22.330
I really really really appreciate it.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.633
So thank you guys again for watching,

00:12:23.633 --> 00:12:26.927
I believe in you, I hope you
continue to believe in yourself

00:12:26.927 --> 00:12:29.045
and whatever your one word is.

00:12:29.045 --> 00:12:31.462
Much love, I'll see you soon.

00:12:37.829 --> 00:12:39.253
- But here's the thing though,

00:12:39.253 --> 00:12:42.036
people see you on stage, they
see you on tour for years,

00:12:42.036 --> 00:12:45.095
we know you do well, it's documented.

00:12:45.095 --> 00:12:48.762
But I try to get
onlookers, fans, listeners,

00:12:51.615 --> 00:12:55.112
to understand that there's
no difference necessarily

00:12:55.112 --> 00:12:56.310
in people, so--

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:58.507
- Nah, we all have the same emotions.

00:12:58.507 --> 00:13:01.449
- Same emotions, we're all
going through the same issues,

00:13:01.449 --> 00:13:03.478
and even though you see
Tech N9ne on this show,

00:13:03.478 --> 00:13:04.339
Sway in the Morning,

00:13:04.339 --> 00:13:07.313
or you might see him on
some award show stage,

00:13:07.313 --> 00:13:10.774
behind closed doors, he's
experiencing the same thing

00:13:10.774 --> 00:13:14.266
your neighbor might be experiencing.

00:13:14.266 --> 00:13:16.381
- And that's how we make fans
man, you know what I'm sayin'.

00:13:16.381 --> 00:13:20.078
That brings us down on
a level playing field,

00:13:20.078 --> 00:13:20.911
you know what I mean,

00:13:20.911 --> 00:13:23.918
'cause they look at us elevated, on stage,

00:13:23.918 --> 00:13:25.913
they automatically lookin' up.

00:13:25.913 --> 00:13:28.595
So when you tell them,
"I'm havin' a bad day

00:13:28.595 --> 00:13:30.466
"because my people are turnin' on me,

00:13:30.466 --> 00:13:32.506
"and I thought these people were real,"

00:13:32.506 --> 00:13:34.134
it brings us on a level playing field,

00:13:34.134 --> 00:13:35.479
and they're like, "He feels just like me."

00:13:35.479 --> 00:13:37.763
and that's how we make fans,
you know what I'm sayin'.

00:13:37.763 --> 00:13:39.592
I tapped into emotions,

00:13:39.592 --> 00:13:41.881
and a lot of my fans know about my life

00:13:41.881 --> 00:13:43.793
because I put it in my
records, you know what I mean,

00:13:43.793 --> 00:13:47.861
to where the wife used to,
when This Ring came out,

00:13:47.861 --> 00:13:50.177
well she didn't like that,
you know what I'm sayin',

00:13:50.177 --> 00:13:52.657
back then but This Ring is like
the best song I ever wrote.

00:13:52.657 --> 00:13:55.930
Pain works, you know what I
mean, so when I did the song

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.599
I Love You But (bleep) You, she said,

00:13:57.599 --> 00:13:59.308
"Don't write nothing else
about me if it ain't positive."

00:13:59.308 --> 00:14:01.303
and I said, "Okay, I'll stop it."

00:14:01.303 --> 00:14:02.317
(laughter)

00:14:02.317 --> 00:14:04.599
- [Female Host] No more songs about her.

00:14:04.599 --> 00:14:06.732
You know what I'm sayin',
my little girl Rainbow said

00:14:06.732 --> 00:14:09.017
that she didn't like me to
do the lewd stuff on stage,

00:14:09.017 --> 00:14:10.769
like how I would do the song Seven Words

00:14:10.769 --> 00:14:13.414
and lay in between the ladies,
you know what I'm sayin',

00:14:13.414 --> 00:14:14.961
so I stopped that, you
know what I'm sayin',

00:14:14.961 --> 00:14:17.326
It's like, I do what they
say, you know what I'm sayin',

00:14:17.326 --> 00:14:20.300
these ladies that I take care
of, you know what I'm sayin',

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.942
and Aaliyah, she's just, she's 22 now man,

00:14:22.942 --> 00:14:26.236
she's out there in Oakland,
just having a wonderful time,

00:14:26.236 --> 00:14:27.820
doing broadcasting and everything,

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.368
she don't have too many problems.

00:14:29.368 --> 00:14:32.201
Rainbow, I can't really talk about

00:14:33.229 --> 00:14:35.504
what's going on with my little
one 'cause she don't want it,

00:14:35.504 --> 00:14:37.903
but she got sick man, and I was just like,

00:14:37.903 --> 00:14:40.358
"God why me," you know what I'm sayin'.

00:14:40.358 --> 00:14:42.233
And she's probably like "God why me,"

00:14:42.233 --> 00:14:43.168
you know what I'm sayin'

00:14:43.168 --> 00:14:45.124
and my mama was sick all those years,

00:14:45.124 --> 00:14:47.199
and now my youngster,
you know what I'm saying,

00:14:47.199 --> 00:14:50.663
it's like damn, but in
the midst of all that,

00:14:50.663 --> 00:14:54.209
we still have time to
give ourselves to our fans

00:14:54.209 --> 00:14:56.324
and our people that want to
hear, 'cause it's a blessing

00:14:56.324 --> 00:14:58.728
for people to want to hear anything,

00:14:58.728 --> 00:15:00.314
especially these days being in the game

00:15:00.314 --> 00:15:02.961
as long as I've been,
you know what I mean,

00:15:02.961 --> 00:15:05.445
it's like, it's such a blessing,

00:15:05.445 --> 00:15:07.157
that they still want to listen.

00:15:07.157 --> 00:15:10.418
And I'm going to forever
have these stories to tell,

00:15:10.418 --> 00:15:11.518
because I'm writin' my life,

00:15:11.518 --> 00:15:13.026
and that's what I chose
to do back in the day

00:15:13.026 --> 00:15:14.367
when Quincy Jones told me,

00:15:14.367 --> 00:15:16.209
"Write what you know and
people will forever feel you."

